window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["people-kiryuin-fuuka"]=[{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v2-p29-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin in the shoplifting investigation she bursts into the student council meeting and exposes nagumo s shoplifting order  she stops ayanokoji outside the council room and asks him to investigate the shoplifting case  kiryuin was present in these scenes  entries already exist in the year 2  vol  9 block for the same character","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v2-p29-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kiryūin in the shoplifting investigation<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.29–33, 76–78<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She bursts into the student council meeting and exposes Nagumo&#x27;s shoplifting order. She stops Ayanokōji outside the council room and asks him to investigate the shoplifting case.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Kiryūin was present in these scenes; entries already exist in the Year 2, Vol. 9 block for the same character.<span class=\"pg\">p.29–33, 76–78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v3-p50-1","v":"y2v3","y":2,"o":18,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin senpai  a fellow solo third year spotted among the calm class 3 b students disembarking  approaches ayanokoji at the starting area while he searches for nagumo   you re still here  ayanokoji   but you re alone  right  you should be fine to think it over while you walk   if there s something you wanna know  i can help explain it to you   there s something  enchanting about seeing the entire student body scatter throughout the uninhabited island   though there are more than 400 of us  we re nothing but insignificant specks of dust in comparison   hoh  sounds like we ve got the same destination then  at least for this first one   please don t be too hard on me  then  a third year  class 3 b  who also chose to tackle the exam alone   keen eyed  questions why he lingers  calm  even wistful  enchanting   insignificant specks of dust  and seemingly looking forward to the exam  shares his d7 destination and proposes traveling together  recognizes him  offers help  then travels with him toward d7","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v3-p50-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kiryūin-senpai, a fellow solo third-year<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V3 · p.50–52<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Spotted among the calm Class 3-B students disembarking; approaches Ayanokōji at the starting area while he searches for Nagumo.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You&#x27;re still here, Ayanokōji?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;But you&#x27;re alone, right? You should be fine to think it over while you walk.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If there&#x27;s something you wanna know, I can help explain it to you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;There&#x27;s something… enchanting about seeing the entire student body scatter throughout the uninhabited island.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Though there are more than 400 of us, we&#x27;re nothing but insignificant specks of dust in comparison.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Hoh? Sounds like we&#x27;ve got the same destination then. At least for this first one.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Please don&#x27;t be too hard on me, then.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> A third-year (Class 3-B) who also chose to tackle the exam alone — keen-eyed (questions why he lingers), calm, even wistful (&quot;enchanting,&quot; &quot;insignificant specks of dust&quot;), and seemingly looking forward to the exam; shares his D7 destination and proposes traveling together.<span class=\"pg\">p.50–52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Recognizes him; offers help, then travels with him toward D7.<span class=\"pg\">p.50–52<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v4-p261-1","v":"y2v4","y":2,"o":19,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiba-katsunori tsukishiro kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin intervenes at i2 appears during the 2 on 1 fight   had watched from behind a tree  deliberately broke her watch so her gps wouldn t show her approach   i wonder what the acting director and the classroom teacher do with a student in such a deserted place   actually  i ve been watching you from behind the big tree for a while  but i couldn t take the two on one situation   of course  as your senpai  shouldn t it be normal for me to protect my kouhai   i ll tell you  i ll hold them for a minute or two at least   keep your fists up and try to create an atmosphere of tension   i am a lady  what do you think    on whether she s hit anyone playful and bold   breaks her own watch to sneak up  appears to protect her  kouhai  holds shiba  a  ridiculous level  fighter  through defense alone  and teases ayanokoji into a fighting pose  afterward exhausted but proud  intervenes on his behalf  calls him  kouhai  and helps him win  holds him off while ayanokoji fights tsukishiro  confronts the acting director over fighting a student in a deserted place","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v4-p261-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kiryūin intervenes at I2<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4 · p.261–273<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears during the 2-on-1 fight — had watched from behind a tree, deliberately broke her watch so her GPS wouldn&#x27;t show her approach.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"index.html#shiba-katsunori\">Shiba Katsunori<\/a> · <a href=\"tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I wonder what the Acting Director and the classroom teacher do with a student in such a deserted place.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.261<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Actually, I&#x27;ve been watching you from behind the big tree for a while, but I couldn&#x27;t take the two-on-one situation.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.262<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Of course. As your senpai, shouldn&#x27;t it be normal for me to protect my kouhai?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.263<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;ll tell you. I&#x27;ll hold them for a minute or two at least.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.263<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Keep your fists up and try to create an atmosphere of tension.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.263<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I am a lady. What do you think?&quot; — on whether she&#x27;s hit anyone<span class=\"pg\">p.264<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Playful and bold — breaks her own watch to sneak up, appears to protect her &quot;kouhai,&quot; holds Shiba (a &quot;ridiculous level&quot; fighter) through defense alone, and teases Ayanokōji into a fighting pose; afterward exhausted but proud.<span class=\"pg\">p.261–273<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Intervenes on his behalf, calls him &quot;kouhai,&quot; and helps him win.<span class=\"pg\">p.261–272<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiba Katsunori<\/b> Holds him off while Ayanokōji fights Tsukishiro.<span class=\"pg\">p.263–270<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Confronts the acting director over fighting a student in a deserted place.<span class=\"pg\">p.261<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v4_5-p38-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiriyama nagumo-miyabi kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin at the pool  teasing ayanokoji and kiriyama  looks like you might be in trouble  ayanokoji   it looks like quite the frightening strategy to me   as expected of the student council president  he s played a bizarre  yet effective card against this flawless person in front of me   we re comrades that have been through the line of fire together  so i know that your abilities are limitless  right   to nagumo  you should ve been nothing more than a toy   i can tell that he s the type of person you re no good at dealing with  am i right   i m sorry  but i can t help you with this one   if there were a retention system at this school  i might ve considered it   ayanokoji and i are in a romantic relationship   fufu  it s a joke kiriyama  relaxed on a deck chair in sunglasses  she reads the third years  surveillance and nagumo s strategy clearly  praises ayanokoji s  limitless  ability  they re  comrades  from i2  declines to help  wants a quiet life  almost wishes she could repeat a year  and deliberately needles the deadpan kiriyama   even joking that she and ayanokoji are  in a romantic relationship  teases and accurately reads him  they re  comrades  from the i2 incident  needles the irritable vice president  he tries to escape her  understands his strategy and character well","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v4_5-p38-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kiryūin at the pool: teasing Ayanokōji and Kiriyama<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.38–45<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"kiriyama.html\">Kiriyama<\/a> · <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Looks like you might be in trouble, Ayanokōji.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It looks like quite the frightening strategy to me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.41<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;As expected of the Student Council President. He&#x27;s played a bizarre, yet effective card against this flawless person in front of me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.41<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;We&#x27;re comrades that have been through the line of fire together, so I know that your abilities are limitless, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.41<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;To Nagumo, you should&#x27;ve been nothing more than a toy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I can tell that he&#x27;s the type of person you&#x27;re no good at dealing with. Am I right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m sorry, but I can&#x27;t help you with this one.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If there were a retention system at this school, I might&#x27;ve considered it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Ayanokōji and I are in a romantic relationship.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.44<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Fufu, it&#x27;s a joke Kiriyama.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.44<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Relaxed on a deck chair in sunglasses, she reads the third-years&#x27; surveillance and Nagumo&#x27;s strategy clearly, praises Ayanokōji&#x27;s &quot;limitless&quot; ability (they&#x27;re &quot;comrades&quot; from I2), declines to help (wants a quiet life, almost wishes she could repeat a year), and deliberately needles the deadpan Kiriyama — even joking that she and Ayanokōji are &quot;in a romantic relationship.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.38–45<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Teases and accurately reads him; they&#x27;re &quot;comrades&quot; from the I2 incident.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–44<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> Needles the irritable vice president; he tries to escape her.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–45<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Understands his strategy and character well.<span class=\"pg\">p.41–43<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v4_5-p289-1\">→ After: Short story: &quot;When You are the Older One&quot; — the stares at the pool<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v4_5-p289-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"narration","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka nagumo-miyabi kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka short story   when you are the older one    the stares at the pool from her own pov  relaxing by the pool in sunglasses  notices the third years all look at ayanokoji in unison  curious  she calls out to him  her  off mode  switch flips on   spending a holiday like this just relaxing ain t bad from time to time   i see  so that s what s going on   looks like you re in for some trouble  ayanokouji   i m talking about the 3rd year students  there s no way you haven t noticed them  am i right   so you did notice after all  relaxed but sharp   reads nagumo s surveillance of ayanokoji at once  notes he s only pretending not to notice  and is fascinated by him  ayanokoji is seriously an interesting man  wishes  wistfully  that they were the same age so she could observe him for another year   a feeling forming  within me  finds him interesting  teases him about the stares and senses nagumo is taking him seriously  her fellow third year  his involvement means  trouble is brewing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v4_5-p289-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Short story: &quot;When You are the Older One&quot; — the stares at the pool<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.289–290<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">From her own POV, relaxing by the pool in sunglasses, notices the third-years all look at Ayanokōji in unison; curious, she calls out to him (her &quot;OFF-mode&quot; switch flips ON).<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;Spending a holiday like this just relaxing ain&#x27;t bad from time to time.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.289<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;I see… so that&#x27;s what&#x27;s going on.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.289<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;Looks like you&#x27;re in for some trouble, Ayanokouji.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.289<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Narration<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m talking about the 3rd year students. There&#x27;s no way you haven&#x27;t noticed them, am I right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.290<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Narration<\/span> &quot;So you did notice after all.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.290<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Relaxed but sharp — reads Nagumo&#x27;s surveillance of Ayanokōji at once, notes he&#x27;s only pretending not to notice, and is fascinated by him (Ayanokōji is seriously an interesting man); wishes, wistfully, that they were the same age so she could observe him for another year — a feeling forming &quot;within me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.289–290<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Finds him interesting; teases him about the stares and senses Nagumo is taking him seriously.<span class=\"pg\">p.289–290<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Her fellow third-year; his involvement means &quot;trouble is brewing.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.290<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v4_5-p38-1\">← Before: Kiryūin at the pool: teasing Ayanokōji and Kiriyama<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v6-p11-1","v":"y2v6","y":2,"o":22,"k":"","w":"kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin fuuka mentioned in passing named in this volume  passing mentions on pages  p 252 253  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v6-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">kiryuin-fuuka mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V6 · p.11-346<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in this volume.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions on pages: p.252-253.<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v7-p7-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin fuuka mentioned in passing named in this volume  passing mentions on pages  p 39  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v7-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">kiryuin-fuuka mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.7-207<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in this volume.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions on pages: p.39.<span class=\"pg\">p.7<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.7<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p29-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi kiriyama-ikuto ichinose-honami kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin interrupts the election meeting she enters the student council room without knocking to press an appointment she says kiriyama made with her  and refuses nagumo s attempt to put her off   going so far as to put her foot on an empty chair   let me interrupt you  nagumo   i refuse  blunt  impatient and confrontational   she ignores protocol  refuses to wait quietly  and is undeterred by the president  she brushes off his demand that she wait  he calls her an unexpected guest  says he had agreed to make time for her  she lays out the accusation   that yamanaka  a third year class d student  tried to slip lipstick into her bag at keyaki mall and blamed nagumo   and offers to drop the matter if nagumo apologizes   you don t understand me well enough to say  it s not like me  unfortunately  i have a great dislike for acts like shoplifting   you can rest assured  if i can hear an apology from you  i promise you that this matter will be put to rest  unaware of ichinose s shoplifting past  she speaks bluntly about her hatred of the act  when nagumo refuses and walks away  she is stunned  her blunt talk of shoplifting darkens ichinose s expression   unknowingly striking a nerve","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p29-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kiryūin interrupts the election meeting<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.29–30<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She enters the student-council room without knocking to press an appointment she says Kiriyama made with her, and refuses Nagumo&#x27;s attempt to put her off — going so far as to put her foot on an empty chair. She lays out the accusation — that Yamanaka, a third-year Class D student, tried to slip lipstick into her bag at Keyaki Mall and blamed Nagumo — and offers to drop the matter if Nagumo apologizes.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Let me interrupt you, Nagumo.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I refuse.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You don&#x27;t understand me well enough to say &#x27;it&#x27;s not like me.&#x27; Unfortunately, I have a great dislike for acts like shoplifting.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Blunt, impatient and confrontational — she ignores protocol, refuses to wait quietly, and is undeterred by the president.<span class=\"pg\">p.29–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> She brushes off his demand that she wait; he calls her an unexpected guest.<span class=\"pg\">p.29–30<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> Says he had agreed to make time for her.<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You can rest assured. If I can hear an apology from you, I promise you that this matter will be put to rest.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Unaware of Ichinose&#x27;s shoplifting past, she speaks bluntly about her hatred of the act; when Nagumo refuses and walks away, she is stunned.<span class=\"pg\">p.31–32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Her blunt talk of shoplifting darkens Ichinose&#x27;s expression — unknowingly striking a nerve.<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p76-1\">→ After: Kiryūin recruits Ayanokōji to investigate<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p76-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka nagumo-miyabi kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin recruits ayanokoji to investigate she stops ayanokoji outside the council room and asks him to dig into the shoplifting case   nagumo and kiriyama have blocked her from re questioning yamanaka  and she needs someone with a neutral perspective and fighting ability   can i have a moment of your time  ayanokouji   no  my pride won t allow me to meditate on his attempt to incriminate me   cooperate with me  i don t have anyone i can call a friend  i can t act like a detective  prideful but strategic   she refuses to let the frame up rest  flatters ayanokoji s abilities  and invokes his debt from the island exam to force his cooperation  presses him into investigating by appealing to his neutrality and fighting sense  blocked by him from re questioning yamanaka","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p76-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kiryūin recruits Ayanokōji to investigate<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.76–78<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She stops Ayanokōji outside the council room and asks him to dig into the shoplifting case — Nagumo and Kiriyama have blocked her from re-questioning Yamanaka, and she needs someone with a neutral perspective and fighting ability.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Can I have a moment of your time, Ayanokouji?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;No. My pride won&#x27;t allow me to meditate on his attempt to incriminate me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Cooperate with me. I don&#x27;t have anyone I can call a friend. I can&#x27;t act like a detective.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Prideful but strategic — she refuses to let the frame-up rest, flatters Ayanokōji&#x27;s abilities, and invokes his debt from the island exam to force his cooperation.<span class=\"pg\">p.76–78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Presses him into investigating by appealing to his neutrality and fighting sense.<span class=\"pg\">p.76–78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Blocked by him from re-questioning Yamanaka.<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p29-1\">← Before: Kiryūin interrupts the election meeting<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p180-1\">→ After: Kiryūin: the shoplifting complaint and her demand for an apology<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p180-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"kiriyama-ikuto nagumo-miyabi kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin  the shoplifting complaint and her demand for an apology in the hearing she files a complaint over the attempt to frame her as a shoplifter  revealing that the third year yamanaka confessed she had been instructed   and naming nagumo as the alleged orderer   sorry to keep you waiting  new student council president   i just can t believe yamanaka acted out of personal resentment  she presses nagumo  spars with kiriyama  and rejects a quiet cover up  when kiriyama finally confesses he used her as the target  her sole demand is an apology from the real culprit   all i want is an apology from the real culprit  direct and principled   she refuses to let the matter be buried  wants the truth rather than a convenient story  and cares about the apology more than punishment  her classmate whom she suspected  he confesses he framed her deliberately  she names him as the one who allegedly ordered the framing  he denies it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p180-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kiryūin: the shoplifting complaint and her demand for an apology<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.180–190<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In the hearing she files a complaint over the attempt to frame her as a shoplifter, revealing that the third-year Yamanaka confessed she had been instructed — and naming Nagumo as the alleged orderer. She presses Nagumo, spars with Kiriyama, and rejects a quiet cover-up; when Kiriyama finally confesses he used her as the target, her sole demand is an apology from the real culprit.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a> · <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Sorry to keep you waiting, new student council president.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I just can&#x27;t believe Yamanaka acted out of personal resentment.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;All I want is an apology from the real culprit.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.186<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Direct and principled — she refuses to let the matter be buried, wants the truth rather than a convenient story, and cares about the apology more than punishment.<span class=\"pg\">p.180–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> Her classmate whom she suspected; he confesses he framed her deliberately.<span class=\"pg\">p.189–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> She names him as the one who allegedly ordered the framing; he denies it.<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9-p76-1\">← Before: Kiryūin recruits Ayanokōji to investigate<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9_5-p45-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka ch 3  kiryuin at the mall  the yogurt maker exchange finds ayanokoji staring at the supermarket s dairy section  hunched over and bereft over the sold out yogurt maker from the keyaki mall sale  walks him out of his daze  laughs at his loss  advises buying online  shows him the same model at the same price as the sale  reveals she knew it wasn t a real sale  reveals she followed him only from curiosity about his unusual name  confesses that she once wanted to repeat a grade to keep watching him train  declines even 20 million private points to rush to class a  says private points can t buy everything  e g  she remarks she once tried to use points to fire the teachers she didn t like   no comment  reveals she was a grandchild raised by her ojii sama  ojou sama  at home  picked this school to escape being born into wealth  plans scholarship   part time to live a normal unremarkable life   like his  says nagumo is gathering rumors of second years for the third term  that the special exam ahead might be more troublesome than he thinks  her memory of last year s second term special exam is oddly vague  they part   before feeling down  try looking online  you might find it surprisingly cheap   if there was a system to repeat a grade in this school   this is just my intuition  but i have a feeling that we ll meet again somewhere  follows him to the mall  talks about privilege  class a and self funded lives  he listens but reveals nothing  mutual respect under the odds  her  failure  to join any class battle teams her with a person who genuinely doesn t care about rank","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9_5-p45-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: Kiryūin at the mall; the yogurt-maker exchange<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.45–58<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Finds Ayanokōji staring at the supermarket&#x27;s dairy section, hunched-over and bereft over the sold-out yogurt maker from the Keyaki Mall sale; walks him out of his daze. Laughs at his loss, advises buying online; shows him the same model at the same price as the sale; reveals she knew it wasn&#x27;t a real sale; reveals she followed him only from curiosity about his unusual name. Confesses that she once wanted to repeat a grade to keep watching him train; declines even 20 million private points to rush to Class A; says private points can&#x27;t buy everything (e.g. she remarks she once tried to use points to fire the teachers she didn&#x27;t like — no-comment). Reveals she was a grandchild raised by her ojii-sama (&quot;ojou-sama&quot; at home); picked this school to escape being born into wealth; plans scholarship + part-time to live a normal unremarkable life — like his. Says Nagumo is gathering rumors of second-years for the third term, that the special exam ahead might be more troublesome than he thinks; her memory of last year&#x27;s second-term special exam is oddly vague; they part.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Before feeling down, try looking online. You might find it surprisingly cheap.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If there was a system to repeat a grade in this school.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;This is just my intuition, but I have a feeling that we&#x27;ll meet again somewhere.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Follows him to the mall, talks about privilege, Class A and self-funded lives; he listens but reveals nothing; mutual respect under the odds.<span class=\"pg\">p.45–58<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Her &quot;failure&quot; to join any class battle teams her with a person who genuinely doesn&#x27;t care about rank.<span class=\"pg\">p.45–58<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p32-1","v":"y2v11","y":2,"o":30,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka yamamura-miki morishita-ai hashimoto-masayoshi kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka ch 1  the green tea brand class 3 b s kiryuin fuka stops by the beverage cooler  her shoulder lightly collides with yamamura s  she turns her gaze on kiyotaka like a beverage promoter   i like this brand s tea  you can feel the umami and aroma as if it were brewed in a teapot  right ayanokoji   oh  it s good to have a wide circle  you should cherish your friends   i ll remember all three of you  she knows him by name  aloof reputation among third years noted  their shoulders collide  she apologizes to her first  she learns yamamura and morishita are in class a  he introduces himself as class a  she lightly brushes off his offered hand","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p32-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: The green-tea brand<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V11 · p.32–33<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class 3-B&#x27;s Kiryūin Fūka stops by the beverage cooler; her shoulder lightly collides with Yamamura&#x27;s; she turns her gaze on Kiyotaka like a beverage promoter.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"yamamura-miki.html\">Yamamura Miki<\/a> · <a href=\"morishita-ai.html\">Morishita Ai<\/a> · <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I like this brand&#x27;s tea. You can feel the umami and aroma as if it were brewed in a teapot, right Ayanokōji?”<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Oh? It&#x27;s good to have a wide circle. You should cherish your friends.”<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I&#x27;ll remember all three of you.”<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She knows him by name; aloof reputation among third-years noted.<span class=\"pg\">p.32–33<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamamura Miki<\/b> Their shoulders collide; she apologizes to her first.<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Morishita Ai<\/b> She learns Yamamura and Morishita are in Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> He introduces himself as Class A; she lightly brushes off his offered hand.<span class=\"pg\">p.32<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p45-1\">→ After: Ch.2: Hands in her pockets<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p45-1","v":"y2v11","y":2,"o":30,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka ch 2  hands in her pockets after the highway stop  she waits with hands in her jersey jacket pockets as the leader of group 20  the first face he sees at the inn   i m counting on you   now that the greetings are over  let s have lunch  let s disband for now   then i ll leave it to you  she leaves hashimoto to run the lunch  she disappears into the inn alone  her list  16 first second years  kiyotaka is group 20  chosen by nagumo to watch the match  she gives him a lead the group offer","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p45-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: Hands in her pockets<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V11 · p.45–52<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After the highway stop; she waits with hands in her jersey jacket pockets as the leader of Group 20; the first face he sees at the inn.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I&#x27;m counting on you.”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Now that the greetings are over, let&#x27;s have lunch. Let&#x27;s disband for now.”<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Then I&#x27;ll leave it to you.”<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> She leaves Hashimoto to run the lunch; she disappears into the inn alone.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Her list: 16 first/second-years; Kiyotaka is Group 20.<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Chosen by Nagumo to watch the match; she gives him a lead-the-group offer.<span class=\"pg\">p.45–52<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p32-1\">← Before: Ch.1: The green-tea brand<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p60-1\">→ After: Ch.2: She sniffed out the bet<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p60-1","v":"y2v11","y":2,"o":30,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka ch 2  she sniffed out the bet break room  she strolls in late  she already knows about the nagumo match and proposes handing over leader authority   i m sorry i m late  has the discussion been settled   if you want  i can even give you the authority as the leader  of course  on the surface  i ll make it look like i chose the participants  that way  we can compete as a group  can t we   i don t know much about your current friendships  it was a chance encounter  and i just let you choose randomly  if you re uncomfortable in the group  it would be hard to show your true abilities  right   anyway  i m glad the match seems to be happening  nagumo  it s a shame that third year students can t participate in the game directly   it s a rare opportunity involving ayanokoji  of course i want to meet his expectations   sorry  but i ll decline  that ticket price is soaked with the blood and sweat of the entire year  it s too heavy for me  who hasn t been involved  to accept  isn t it  she volunteered the leader role the moment she smelled the match  kiyotaka declines her authority offer  she declines nagumo s class a bet  she knows about the bet before anyone else  she challenges his presumption with cool disinterest  she wants him to shine  he sees through her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p60-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: She sniffed out the bet<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V11 · p.60–62<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Break room; she strolls in late; she already knows about the Nagumo match and proposes handing over leader authority.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I&#x27;m sorry I&#x27;m late. Has the discussion been settled?”<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“If you want, I can even give you the authority as the leader. Of course, on the surface, I&#x27;ll make it look like I chose the participants. That way, we can compete as a group, can&#x27;t we?”<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I don&#x27;t know much about your current friendships. It was a chance encounter, and I just let you choose randomly. If you&#x27;re uncomfortable in the group, it would be hard to show your true abilities, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Anyway, I&#x27;m glad the match seems to be happening, Nagumo. It&#x27;s a shame that third-year students can&#x27;t participate in the game directly.”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It&#x27;s a rare opportunity involving Ayanokōji. Of course I want to meet his expectations.”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Sorry, but I&#x27;ll decline. That ticket price is soaked with the blood and sweat of the entire year. It&#x27;s too heavy for me, who hasn&#x27;t been involved, to accept, isn&#x27;t it?”<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> She volunteered the leader role the moment she smelled the match; Kiyotaka declines her authority offer; she declines Nagumo&#x27;s Class A-bet.<span class=\"pg\">p.60–61<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> She knows about the bet before anyone else; she challenges his presumption with cool disinterest.<span class=\"pg\">p.60–62<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She wants him to shine; he sees through her.<span class=\"pg\">p.60–62<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p45-1\">← Before: Ch.2: Hands in her pockets<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p71-1\">→ After: Ch.2: Between matches<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p71-1","v":"y2v11","y":2,"o":30,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka ch 2  between matches post oshibana in the workshop  she calls him over to talk tension and the match with nagumo   a victory s a good start  though  i didn t feel any tension   but if it s a competition based on experiential learning  it s not strange for anyone to win or lose   hashimoto made this list for me  which makes things easier  he s surprisingly useful   i m grateful for that  all i want to see is the match between you and nagumo  she lets inogashira approach with the koenji problem  she suggests trying to recruit him only if he wins for the private points  she takes no personal responsibility   there s still some time until the next game  why not give it a shot  from what i ve seen  tatebayashi s group is small and unlikely to win  but if koenji is competent  the situation might turn around somewhat  right   of course  the decision is up to you  regardless of the details  the fact that she came to us first is significant  she stays detached  only the match with nagumo interests her  she sees him as a lost cause unless money motivates him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p71-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: Between matches<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V11 · p.71–73<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Post-oshibana in the workshop; she calls him over to talk tension and the match with Nagumo.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“A victory&#x27;s a good start. Though, I didn&#x27;t feel any tension.”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“But if it&#x27;s a competition based on experiential learning, it&#x27;s not strange for anyone to win or lose.”<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hashimoto made this list for me, which makes things easier. He&#x27;s surprisingly useful.”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I&#x27;m grateful for that. All I want to see is the match between you and Nagumo.”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> She lets Inogashira approach with the Kōenji problem; she suggests trying to recruit him only if he wins for the private points; she takes no personal responsibility.<span class=\"pg\">p.72–73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “There&#x27;s still some time until the next game, why not give it a shot? From what I&#x27;ve seen, Tatebayashi&#x27;s group is small and unlikely to win, but if Kōenji is competent, the situation might turn around somewhat. Right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Of course, the decision is up to you. Regardless of the details, the fact that she came to us first is significant.”<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She stays detached; only the match with Nagumo interests her.<span class=\"pg\">p.71–73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> She sees him as a lost cause unless money motivates him.<span class=\"pg\">p.72–73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p60-1\">← Before: Ch.2: She sniffed out the bet<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p79-1\">→ After: Ch.2: The swings<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p79-1","v":"y2v11","y":2,"o":30,"k":"spoken","w":"asahina-nazuna ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka ch 2  the swings east park  she is on the swing with asahina  kiyotaka arrives to report koenji s refusal   are you that happy to talk to me   it s their law department  but i m not particularly attached to the department   hmm  i m not aiming for anything  i m not trying to become anything   i have a dream of not becoming anyone  does that answer your question   if i had to choose a job to achieve something  i might aim to be a politician   no  it was because of opportunities like that that i decided against becoming a politician  i just let their talk go in from one ear and out the other   because it s such a corrupt world  there are also those who shine  he was one of the few people i admired   it s kijima san  he s become quite important now   i don t plan to at the moment   didn t i tell you there s a lot going on   i see  since i m also aiming for the same path  we re both dream chasers in our own way  her dream  be a politician like kijima  now important   the prime minister  she admired him from childhood family ties  she refuses to aim for it because the kiryuin name follows her  asahina hangs on her every word about kijima and her future  she teases that he might become a politician  he declines  she is entertained by his defeat with koenji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p79-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: The swings<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V11 · p.79–83<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">East park; she is on the swing with Asahina; Kiyotaka arrives to report Kōenji&#x27;s refusal.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"asahina-nazuna.html\">Asahina Nazuna<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Are you that happy to talk to me?”<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“It&#x27;s their law department. But I&#x27;m not particularly attached to the department.”<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hmm? I’m not aiming for anything. I’m not trying to become anything.”<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I have a dream of not becoming anyone. Does that answer your question?”<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “If I had to choose a job to achieve something, I might aim to be a politician.”<span class=\"pg\">p.82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “No? It was because of opportunities like that that I decided against becoming a politician. I just let their talk go in from one ear and out the other.”<span class=\"pg\">p.82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Because it&#x27;s such a corrupt world, there are also those who shine. He was one of the few people I admired.”<span class=\"pg\">p.82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It&#x27;s Kijima-san. He&#x27;s become quite important now.”<span class=\"pg\">p.82<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I don&#x27;t plan to at the moment.”<span class=\"pg\">p.83<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Didn&#x27;t I tell you there&#x27;s a lot going on?”<span class=\"pg\">p.83<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I see. Since I&#x27;m also aiming for the same path, we&#x27;re both dream chasers in our own way.”<span class=\"pg\">p.83<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Her dream: be a politician like Kijima (now important / the Prime Minister); she admired him from childhood family ties; she refuses to aim for it because the Kiryūin name follows her.<span class=\"pg\">p.81–83<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Asahina Nazuna<\/b> Asahina hangs on her every word about Kijima and her future.<span class=\"pg\">p.79–83<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She teases that he might become a politician; he declines; she is entertained by his defeat with Kōenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.79–83<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v11-p71-1\">← Before: Ch.2: Between matches<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v12-p12-1","v":"y2v12","y":2,"o":31,"k":"","w":"kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka kiryuin fuuka mentioned in passing named in this volume  passing mention  locator pages  p 63 64  not line by line verified  substring false positives possible  not a scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v12-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">kiryuin-fuuka mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12 · p.12-228<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in this volume.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention (locator pages: p.63-64; not line-by-line verified; substring false positives possible). Not a scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"}];
